# *.local above only matches a bare ".local" extension (e.g. "foo.local"),
# NOT "*.local.json" - verified via `git check-ignore` before trusting it,
# after almost committing the real TURN secret in turn-config.local.json
# because of exactly this gap (2026-09-20). Explicit + a general pattern
# so this can't recur for a similarly-named future local config file.
